To use GraphQL with FastAPI, you can integrate Strawberry, which is recommended and has a design closest to FastAPI's [1]. Here's a small example of how to integrate Strawberry with FastAPI: [1] ```python
import strawberry
from fastapi import FastAPI
from strawberry.fastapi import GraphQLRouter

@strawberry.type
class User:
    name: str
    age: int

@strawberry.type
class Query:
    @strawberry.field
    def user(self) -> User:
        return User(name="Patrick", age=100)

schema = strawberry.Schema(query=Query)

graphql_app = GraphQLRouter(schema)

app = FastAPI()
app.include_router(graphql_app, prefix="/graphql")
```
